Third-party Rust crates in the pocket-tts binary
================================================

The pocket-tts binary in this add-on is Kyutai's release build of
https://github.com/kyutai-labs/pocket-tts (@TAG@). It links the
crates below statically. Each crate's source, at the version named, is on
https://crates.io/crates/<name>/<version>, except ptts, which is
https://github.com/gabrieldemarmiesse/xn-ptts at the commit Cargo.lock names.
The MPL-2.0 crates (symphonia and others) are unmodified; their source is there.

